      {"id":"source-and-privacy","rule":"Keep source access restrictions and privacy protections independent of sensitivity, usefulness, and verified public excerpts."},
      {"id":"expiry-and-usefulness","rule":"Expiry of a token changes token usefulness. Keep the containing log and its internal details protected."},
      {"id":"retention-and-holds","rule":"Preserve any held copy. Request confirmation when hold status is unknown. A stale duplicate may only receive a disposal-review recommendation when marked eligible and the exact hold has verified clearance. The records reviewer must separately authorize any disposition."}
    ]
  },
